NOTE (owner decision, not part of the license grant): the fabric.mod.json "license"
field is set to "ARR" (All Rights Reserved) to match this notice. If GBTI
prefers to publish under a permissive open-source license instead, replace the text
above with the standard MIT License text and change the fabric.mod.json "license"
field from "ARR" to "MIT".

Third-party notes: this mod compiles against the Simple Voice Chat plugin API
(de.maxhenkel.voicechat:voicechat-api) as a compile-only dependency; none of that
API's code is bundled in the released jar. The release jar additionally bundles the
ffmpeg (LGPL), yt-dlp (Unlicense), and deno (MIT) executables, which it runs as
separate processes; see .product/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and docs/HOSTING.md
("Dependency licensing").
